{
  "name": "livespec family — all activity",
  "description": "Dogfooded telemetry for the livespec family (livespec, impl-beads, dev-tooling, runtime, impl-git-jsonl, driver-claude): CI, Red-Green-Replay commit gates, the beads+fabro dispatcher, sandbox runs, and harness sub-agents. Seeded from the captured-history replay (29f pipeline); live data flows once the 29f.3 sandbox→host hop is verified.",
  "type": "flexible",
  "layout_generation": "manual",
  "tags": [
    {
      "key": "team",
      "value": "livespec"
    },
    {
      "key": "kind",
      "value": "dogfood"
    }
  ],
  "panels": [
    {
      "type": "query",
      "key": "prs-merged-green-per-hour-by-repo",
      "dataset": "pr-throughput",
      "query_style": "combo",
      "position": {
        "x_coordinate": 0,
        "y_coordinate": 0,
        "height": 9,
        "width": 8
      },
      "annotation": {
        "name": "THROUGHPUT — PRs merged green per hour, by repository",
        "description": "THE ONE METRIC of the throughput track (livespec-dev-tooling-q26e3c). COUNT of merged pull requests whose covering default-branch CI run concluded success, per hour, by repo. One event per merged PR, timestamped at the merge. Green = the first CI push run at or after the PR's merge head that reached a verdict succeeded (a concurrency-cancelled run is not a verdict). Emitter: the merged-green reconciler (livespec-dev-tooling-gaetnq; a stopgap emits until it lands). Definition: plan/throughput-track-organization/research/003."
      },
      "query": {
        "calculations": [
          {
            "op": "COUNT"
          }
        ],
        "filters": [
          {
            "column": "pr.merged_green",
            "op": "=",
            "value": true
          }
        ],
        "breakdowns": [
          "repo"
        ],
        "orders": [
          {
            "op": "COUNT",
            "order": "descending"
          }
        ],
        "time_range": 86400,
        "granularity": 3600
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "query",
      "key": "prs-merged-not-green-by-repo",
      "dataset": "pr-throughput",
      "query_style": "combo",
      "position": {
        "x_coordinate": 8,
        "y_coordinate": 0,
        "height": 9,
        "width": 4
      },
      "annotation": {
        "name": "Merged but NOT green — PRs per hour, by repository",
        "description": "The loss beside the one metric: merged pull requests whose covering default-branch CI run FAILED, per hour, by repo. Every one of these is a PR the throughput metric does not count."
      },
      "query": {
        "calculations": [
          {
            "op": "COUNT"
          }
        ],
        "filters": [
          {
            "column": "pr.merged_green",
            "op": "=",
            "value": false
          }
        ],
        "breakdowns": [
          "repo"
        ],
        "orders": [
          {
            "op": "COUNT",
            "order": "descending"
          }
        ],
        "time_range": 86400,
        "granularity": 3600
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "position": {
        "x_coordinate": 0,
        "y_coordinate": 9,
        "height": 4,
        "width": 6
      },
      "text_panel": {
        "content": "## livespec family — all activity\n\nOne view across the family's dogfooded telemetry. **Sources:** `github-ci` (CI runs + per-check jobs), `livespec-rgr` (Red→Green commit-gate cycles), `livespec-dispatcher` (beads+fabro dispatch stages), `fabro-sandbox` (sandbox runs), `claude-subagents` (harness sub-agents).\n\n_Seeded 2026-06-14 from the captured-history replay (3,311 spans, ~last 60 days). Live emission begins once the 29f.3 sandbox→host OTLP hop is verified. Use the **Service** / **Repo** filters to scope._"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "query",
      "key": "ci-runs-by-outcome",
      "dataset": "github-ci",
      "query_style": "combo",
      "position": {
        "x_coordinate": 6,
        "y_coordinate": 9,
        "height": 8,
        "width": 4
      },
      "annotation": {
        "name": "CI runs by outcome",
        "description": "CI workflow runs grouped by conclusion (success / failure / action_required)."
      },
      "query": {
        "breakdowns": [
          "ci.conclusion"
        ],
        "calculations": [
          {
            "op": "COUNT"
          }
        ],
        "filters": [
          {
            "column": "name",
            "op": "=",
            "value": "ci.run",
            "join_column": ""
          }
        ],
        "orders": [
          {
            "op": "COUNT",
            "order": "descending"
          }
        ],
        "time_range": 7776000,
        "granularity": 86400
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "query",
      "key": "slowest-ci-checks-p50-p90-ms",
      "dataset": "github-ci",
      "query_style": "combo",
      "position": {
        "x_coordinate": 0,
        "y_coordinate": 17,
        "height": 12,
        "width": 4
      },
      "annotation": {
        "name": "Slowest CI checks — P50 / P90 (ms)",
        "description": "Per-check CI job durations. check-coverage P90 ~83s is the slow tail (motivates the 7us.8 fastest-first gate)."
      },
      "query": {
        "breakdowns": [
          "ci.job.name"
        ],
        "calculations": [
          {
            "column": "duration_ms",
            "op": "P50"
          },
          {
            "column": "duration_ms",
            "op": "P90"
          }
        ],
        "filters": [
          {
            "column": "ci.job.name",
            "op": "exists",
            "join_column": ""
          }
        ],
        "orders": [
          {
            "column": "duration_ms",
            "op": "P90",
            "order": "descending"
          }
        ],
        "limit": 15,
        "time_range": 7776000,
        "granularity": 86400
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "query",
      "key": "red-green-cycle-duration-by-repo-ms",
      "dataset": "livespec-rgr",
      "query_style": "combo",
      "position": {
        "x_coordinate": 4,
        "y_coordinate": 17,
        "height": 20,
        "width": 4
      },
      "annotation": {
        "name": "Red→Green cycle duration by repo (ms)",
        "description": "RGR commit-gate cycle time (impl + Red gate + Green gate) per family repo."
      },
      "query": {
        "breakdowns": [
          "repo"
        ],
        "calculations": [
          {
            "column": "duration_ms",
            "op": "P50"
          },
          {
            "column": "duration_ms",
            "op": "P90"
          },
          {
            "column": "duration_ms",
            "op": "MAX"
          },
          {
            "op": "COUNT"
          }
        ],
        "orders": [
          {
            "op": "COUNT",
            "order": "descending"
          }
        ],
        "limit": 10,
        "time_range": 7776000,
        "granularity": 86400
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "query",
      "key": "dispatcher-stage-durations-ms",
      "dataset": "livespec-dispatcher",
      "query_style": "combo",
